 "title": "P&L Guide in Intacct (DMs Only)",
 "description": "This guide provides step-by-step instructions on how to navigate Intacct and view the Profit and Loss (P&L) statement. It also explains how to review for incorrect charges, access drill-down capabilities, search for invoices, and favorite menu options. Additionally, it provides guidance on fixing authorization issues and viewing invoice images. This guide is essential for individuals using Intacct to effectively manage and analyze financial data.",
